{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32344","headline":"雪夜与友生同宿晓寄近邻 · 温庭筠","name":"雪夜与友生同宿晓寄近邻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闭门羣动息，积雪透疎林。\n有客寒方觉，无声晓已深。\n正繁闻近雁，并落起栖禽。\n寂寞寒塘路，怜君独阻寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}